5,1,1,talk,May,,We need to be fair about where this goes. I'll check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log for this point.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm worried about the actual daily experience. I'll look into supervised mornings on the next lane and a visit to the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know the money part! I'll check the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I hope we can all stay friends. I'll look at the station block's meeting minutes and statements at the residents' meeting.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Time is a precious resource. I shall investigate ward filing requirements per the installations clerk and truck arrival time from the crew leader.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, do you think the ledger will show if some people paid more than others?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, do you think the filing requirements will be too tedious for us?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I hope so! That's why I'm checking.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,I just want to make sure we don't pick something that causes more fighting.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is precisely why we must understand the labor involved, Midori.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
