60,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A, rotating, seems the most equal, even if the paperwork is a bit annoying.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,I dislike A because of the narrow frontages. Option B is too much work. Maybe C is best if we can afford it?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Kenji,,C is too expensive. I'd rather rotate and deal with the ward than pay hundreds of thousands of yen.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm afraid C leads to fights over maintenance, and B leads to fights over late bags. A seems safest.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,A requires constant filing. B is a time sink. C is a permanent commitment. I lean toward A for simplicity.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, we can just skip the narrowest spots in the rotation if we have to.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"But that's not equal, May. That's exactly what you wanted to avoid.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"If we do A, we save money. That's the most important thing for some of us.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Midori,,"As long as we agree on the rotation and don't blame each other, A could work.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,It is better to have a rotating burden than a permanent resentment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,May,,I'm voting for A. It's the only way to stop one person from bearing the brunt.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I still worry about the smell and space, but B and C seem worse. I'll go with A.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Kenji,,A is the cheapest. I'm in.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'll vote A to keep the peace.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I agree. A is the most sustainable for our age and energy.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
